Insuperlex is one of [[Aut]]'s siblings, called the Mountain. He is the obstacle set before a hero, and he clashes with [[Divinity/The Narrative/Menhir|the Menhir]] the same way [[Aut]] clashes with [[Divinity/The Narrative/Renge|Renge]]. Those who serve him get nothing but challenges, and of all the narrative siblings he is held to be the worst master.
